        },
        {
          "text": "Farawo aca ahamagaza Mose na Aroni, arababgira, ati Ni munyingingire Uhoraho, ankize ibi bikere, abikūre no mu bantu banje, nanje mpeze ndekure abantu biwe bagende, baje gushikanira Uhoraho ibimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yishura Farawo, ati Pfa kunsigūrira gusa, umbarire igihe nogusabira, mwe n’ abanyarugo bawe n’abantu bawe, kw ibikere vyotikizwa bikakuvako, bikava no mu ngoro zawe, bigasigara mu ruzi honyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
