          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ho n’utabarekura, ngw azogutēza amasinzi y’ibibugu, bibe kuri wewe no ku banyarugo bawe no ku bantu bawe no mu ngoro zawe: amazu y’ Abanyegiputa azokwuzura amasinzi y’ibibugu, bizimanganye no hasi aho bahagaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
