            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abigira artyo: amasinzi y’ibibugu aza ar’ icago mu ngoro ya Farawo no mu nzu z’abanyarugo biwe; kand’ igihugu cose ca Egiputa cononekara kubg’ ayo masinzi y’ibibugu.",
          "type": "text",
